{"title":"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 30","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/f/a5fe0921b8b139306b2e14c8ad9aaceb1ed55d80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor x\\right\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" /> be the greatest integer less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Then the number of real solutions to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/6/e9629b3c69abd899c9c9433c5816f0db6841c829.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2-40\\left\\lfloor x\\right\\rfloor+51 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"172\" height=\"21\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/f/82f13f50ff97c3352a56d1ec89bd0a7250fdb40f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } 0 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }1 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } 2 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } 3 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"342\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We rearrange the equation as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/9/a790bf203189b97ac203e9c7d1e30a106ef8f40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2 = 40\\left\\lfloor x\\right\\rfloor-51$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"141\" height=\"21\" />, where the right-hand side is now clearly an integer, meaning that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/8/a087a1a0ff7b1e56a5ba0365a88fba8314f8baa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2 = n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"17\" /> for some non-negative integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. Therefore, in the case where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/d/44df9cb6ce6f056c64c197a004b64fc4dd3a5aa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/8/8b8f63b0d0d37a30a368f4ba48bee7df09e20fb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"67\" height=\"41\" /> gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/3/08379db44191c6e1ccf42b506043a3b9d5be6b84.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[40\\left\\lfloor\\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{2}\\right\\rfloor-51 = n.\\]\" width=\"151\" height=\"43\" /> To proceed, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be the unique non-negative integer such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/d/fad82fa4841ae3c7c72464263394bcc43b063eda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\leq \\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{2} &lt; a+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"131\" height=\"41\" />, so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/1/0813c2718afd0c6b9f7d8aa87e85e75f3181db74.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}&amp;\\left\\lfloor \\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{2}\\right\\rfloor = a, \\text{ and} \\\\ &amp;4a^2 \\leq n &lt; 4a^2+8a+4,\\end{align*}\" width=\"187\" height=\"68\" /> and our equation reduces to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/2/cb249637ebd13e1820547472a590f6ced16020e4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[40a-51 = n.\\]\" width=\"106\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>The above inequalities therefore become <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/2/ff2f7db7466dbede2324cf6f3e9727af48d90b70.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4a^2 \\leq 40a-51 &lt; 4a^2+8a+4  \\iff 4a^2-40a+51 &lt; 0 \\text{ and } 4a^2-32a+55 &gt; 0,\\]\" width=\"579\" height=\"19\" /> where the first inequality can now be rewritten as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/d/2fdfe9a609ca483e1cd44487b6b37ee07ab84fc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2a-10)^2 \\leq 49$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"125\" height=\"21\" />, i.e. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/0/0e0ad414a7fc70edc28712e859fa52d1df926a86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lvert 2a-10\\right\\rvert \\leq 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"104\" height=\"20\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/4/c444a8efb771ff383914685994cd771dfc6b6453.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2a-10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"75\" height=\"20\" /> is even for all integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, we must in fact have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/1/03107383eb4801e08b9bd0ef7ef6a350afdd7abe.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}\\left\\lvert 2a-10\\right\\rvert \\leq 6 &amp;\\iff \\left\\lvert a-5\\right\\rvert \\leq 3 \\\\ &amp;\\iff 2 \\leq a \\leq 8.\\end{align*}\" width=\"238\" height=\"41\" /> The second inequality similarly simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/1/741c48ded40f10abedcdd4b887994c8b5e681399.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2a-8)^2 &gt; 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"104\" height=\"19\" />, i.e. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/3/333ad7924aed1bdd7a15a8727f524fe290fb5d4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lvert 2a-8\\right\\rvert &gt; 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"95\" height=\"20\" />. As <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/2/312e31fce620888144aa12e72591430640fa7b08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2a-8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"66\" height=\"20\" /> is even, this is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/0/2509ce83bda15d36d0bae7eb2ac8737d7f03dbc8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}\\left\\lvert 2a-8 \\right\\rvert \\geq 4 &amp;\\iff \\left\\lvert a-4\\right\\rvert \\geq 2 \\\\ &amp;\\iff a \\geq 6 \\text{ or } a \\leq 2,\\end{align*}\" width=\"260\" height=\"42\" /> so the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> satisfying both inequalities are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/a/98ac1c611c1ab63fd1f09d992b8ea520b994b3ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 40a-51$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"15\" />, each of these distinct values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> gives a distinct solution for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, and thus for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/8/8b8f63b0d0d37a30a368f4ba48bee7df09e20fb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"67\" height=\"41\" />, giving a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> solutions in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/d/44df9cb6ce6f056c64c197a004b64fc4dd3a5aa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> case.\n</p><p><br />\nAs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is already the largest of the answer choices, this suffices to show that the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/3/fb3626ff02d0ba34a6ae1421f4b5e155992ec4cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" />, but for completeness, we will show that the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/a/36a68e8aa6ec6f48231ad80a4851f84bacf641b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> case indeed gives no other solutions. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/3/8d33bc84d5515acaa0d13494345d3b6e28902bd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -\\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"81\" height=\"41\" /> (and so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/d/f3d1431ad346632b25a0e7b3f12ebe19723b3960.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />), we require <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/337b5ff328235ea2af6d338b33ab6c023a6e5cf4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[40\\left\\lfloor -\\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{2}\\right\\rfloor-51 = n,\\]\" width=\"165\" height=\"43\" /> and recalling that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/9/72916c7c8c088c959fb9d34c71f944db8e27c151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor -x\\right\\rfloor = -\\left\\lceil x\\right\\rceil$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"110\" height=\"20\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, this equation can be rewritten as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/8/438a94b8f573138a8734eca42c23f084877c1e62.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-40\\left\\lceil \\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{2}\\right\\rceil-51 = n.\\]\" width=\"164\" height=\"42\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is positive, the least possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/3/7837e4b16018fc834f0912625f7178a19277e81e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lceil \\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{2}\\right\\rceil$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"46\" height=\"43\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, but this means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/2/35261407fd221b506699726586ae53ce33a8e0da.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}n &amp;= -40\\left\\lceil\\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{2}\\right\\rceil-51 \\\\ &amp;\\leq -40 \\cdot 1 - 51 \\\\ &amp;= -91,\\end{align*}\" width=\"160\" height=\"92\" /> which is a contradiction. Therefore the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/a/36a68e8aa6ec6f48231ad80a4851f84bacf641b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> case indeed gives no further solutions, confirming that the total number of solutions is precisely <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/c/2aca92e16814e44167d906f29b84b0c1311dde2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(E)} \\ 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"52\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This equation is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/d/1dd471442f1f73714f1829552a386b8f9e9d0a98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2 - 40x + 40x - 40\\lfloor x \\rfloor + 51 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"271\" height=\"21\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/c/6fc88a285353954947ebe36ec00e7e53222e689d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2 - 40x + 51 + 40(x - \\lfloor x \\rfloor) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"267\" height=\"21\" />.  Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/f/00fc6a0d316131539a685aca6deee35129c1dc93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{x\\} = x - \\lfloor x \\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"109\" height=\"19\" /> be the fractional part of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.  Then this equation becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/1/e215f5f1b48d3cce3aade8232238c314636ee008.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2 - 40x + 51 + 40\\{x\\} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"222\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Note that for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/6/4166c6a2fc9b4d81ddbf8aef976ea3a885b69963.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\leq \\{x\\} &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" />.  Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/7/0c7c02ac1dd59323df2c10e87bce64eca5202a7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2 - 40x + 51 \\leq 4x^2 - 40x + 51 + 40\\{x\\} \\leq 4x^2 - 40x + 91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"474\" height=\"21\" />, that is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/b/37b87838ac6b62c007da614128cefd2a3890a3b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2 - 40x + 51 \\leq 0 &lt; 4x^2 - 40x + 91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"296\" height=\"19\" />.  \n</p><p>First, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/c/a0c4e0629d8cb51ba5bb8473888bd75ccb5e4c00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2 - 40x + 51 = (2x - 17)(2x - 3) \\leq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"316\" height=\"21\" />, it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/6/056b697a609526bd925a273fcd5b676f629e0fd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{2} \\leq x \\leq \\frac{17}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"96\" height=\"38\" />.  \n</p><p>Also, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/f/97fecb8ef6ad5718d5f8a61ed5118e2dec999107.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2 - 40x + 91 = (2x - 13)(2x - 7) &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"316\" height=\"21\" />, either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/6/d06af81a1cb67d386da9cf413e7032f76aec661f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; \\frac{7}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/9/2097c264a7f9af5d28888ca2e639f85ea5961938.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; \\frac{13}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"59\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Thus either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/a/87af044e856256d3c250c6090c588836803114cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{2} \\leq x &lt; \\frac{7}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"87\" height=\"38\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/e/44e3c1124d07e71f0e4a6266fc9862c9a46bea90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{13}{2} &lt; x \\leq \\frac{17}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"105\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bf6645468dd0548cd7dd9aa5a5c48914f69958b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x \\rfloor \\in \\{1, 2, 3, 6, 7, 8\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"164\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Isolating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b2878564ab19b80abb21ba964abe90fe120846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> in the original equation yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/f/20f48c69f965e8c11fd0841cfe7c6ba8a1e4973d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 = \\frac{40\\lfloor x \\rfloor - 51}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"133\" height=\"40\" />.  \n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/1/e61178d8b37e9e00ed2eec2fb78fbc7a038c5070.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x \\rfloor = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"62\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/b/f8bc45e45a515da7bb8e6206eb3c04f3bf4f6e32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 = -\\frac{11}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"80\" height=\"38\" />.  This does not yield any valid solutions as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b2878564ab19b80abb21ba964abe90fe120846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> may not be negative.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/4/d5407dba81e7b1bf9c4633adafb432b0ad37cd50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x \\rfloor = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"62\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/a/c5a12da720f299b6ed3934e01f8bcc419de25f57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 = \\frac{29}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"66\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/1/c0134ba736316bf597381802e57dbab09e2a8117.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{\\sqrt{29}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"74\" height=\"43\" />.  This is a valid solution since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/3/f43b0417f4d53f8c651ae7b9a53f7af6bb52dc91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor\\frac{\\sqrt{29}}{2}\\right\\rfloor = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"95\" height=\"55\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/5/61569ebe8584a991897c403bccfefe2809c7021a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x \\rfloor = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"62\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/6/8363eb47693bd4c7e4f1abecfaf95ec36964e74e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 = \\frac{69}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"66\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/2/2920443581e2d9ce51d4bbab0c1a64c525a35b42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{\\sqrt{69}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"74\" height=\"43\" />.  This is not a valid solution since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/1/761c8523652bb1a7b2fa9124741d3c3d2f7b6659.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor\\frac{\\sqrt{69}}{2}\\right\\rfloor = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"95\" height=\"55\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/e/fdec49277e047b7425df2c10d33038af1e92e0f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x \\rfloor = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"62\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/8/4e808ef5250671565489aa30fbce93851cba0588.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 = \\frac{189}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"75\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/e/0aed0f1632eabd38dfa1338796667eaeba2f4b32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{\\sqrt{189}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"83\" height=\"43\" />.  This is a valid solution since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/3/2a36dc5622724cac7c436f87509e89ca062a3b67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor\\frac{\\sqrt{189}}{2}\\right\\rfloor = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"104\" height=\"55\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c370cd3a4bf6d2fe27f885dc4edc2f79572f9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x \\rfloor = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"62\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/2/7c2a0f58758abe225e104a19fa1da13bade9acdd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 = \\frac{229}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"75\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/2/2d25c2ed9c5e6045ad0216e5e15bc7a5a1c23726.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{\\sqrt{229}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"83\" height=\"43\" />.  This is a valid solution since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/1/0f192cd11c012b3414e48e30dd0f62a03b3f4bd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor\\frac{\\sqrt{229}}{2}\\right\\rfloor = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"104\" height=\"55\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/f/2ff10a7216d3290b1ae753656495fb7a37d52766.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x \\rfloor = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"62\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/845f73c23deb73b66b627d168d70f5ceca14dccc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 = \\frac{269}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"75\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/c/b9cb554589f23dbc4a31a8f66d9e9f1517fa1b5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{\\sqrt{269}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"83\" height=\"43\" />.  This is a valid solution since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/6/5f60dd9cbc55afe9407e00964e31495a258f4c75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor\\frac{\\sqrt{269}}{2}\\right\\rfloor = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"104\" height=\"55\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, this equation as a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/5/64536974782d16f651820ec94114ba6fab890ba3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(\\textbf{E})\\ 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"54\" height=\"32\" /> solutions.\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME\" title=\"1985 AHSME\">1985 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1985\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">Problem 29</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Problem</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\